Hotline Miami co-op mod - notice

This is an unofficial fan mod. It is not made, endorsed or supported by Dennaton Games or Devolver Digital.
Hotline Miami, Hotline Miami 2 and their assets belong to their owners.

The mod does not contain or distribute any part of the games: it patches the copy of Hotline Miami the
player owns (HotlineMiami_Original.exe) on the player's own PC, and reads the HM2 character sprites from the
player's own Hotline Miami 2 install. You need your own copy of the game(s).

